 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 02 00}Hey,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00} I gotta\ntalk to you about my\ncatchphrase!\n{07 06 00}To tell you the truth{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\nI'm kind of tired of saying\n\"{04 02 00}\" all the time.\n{07 0b 00}Can you maybe help me\nthink of something cooler\nto say, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 02 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}! {01 01 00}{07 16 00}You know, I'm\ngetting kinda tired of my\nsignature \"{04 02 00}.\"\n{07 06 00}I need something to say\nthat'll up my cool quotient,\nlike {04 0b 00}.",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 16 00}What?{01 00 00 05 00} Are you sure?{01 00 00 14 00} {07 00 00}Well,{01 00 00 0a 00}\nif you say so, I guess I\nshould, huh, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{07 13 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Huh huh huh{01 07 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 0b 00}Do I seem kinda heroic to\nyou, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{07 00 00}What?! Really?{01 00 00 14 00} {07 0a 00}Yes! That\nmakes me so happy,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{07 00 00}OK, then,{01 00 00 0a 00} I'll leave it\nup to you,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}.",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{07 00 00}So{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 0b 00}you think I should say\n\"{ff 00 00 02}{04 02 00}{ff 00 00 00}\"{01 00 00 0a 00} instead?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{07 00 00}\"{0b 03 00}{04 02 00},\" huh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} {07 0a 00}That\ngoes down as smooth as a\nglass of {04 13 00}!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{07 00 00}\"{0b 03 00}{04 02 00},\" eh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 14 00} {07 0a 00}Sweet!{01 00 00 05 00} I\nthink I felt myself{01 00 00 05 00} get a\nlittle bit cooler!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{07 0e 00}I really think I need some\nkind of catchphrase.\n\n{07 0b 00}But isn't there something\ncooler for me to say,{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{04 02 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Hey,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 1f 00},{01 00 00 0a 00} did you\nknow that every superhero\nneeds a catchphrase?\n{07 14 00}Yeah, it's a fact. {01 00 00 05 00}They need\nsomething to say when they\nfirst swoop into a room!\nYou see where I'm going\nwith this? See, I'm a\nsuperhero myself...\n{07 0a 00}So I need a catchphrase,\ntoo!{01 00 00 05 00} And it's gotta scare\noff dastardly villains!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "en": "{07 04 00}\"{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 02}{01 06 00} {01 07 00}{ff 00 00 00}\"!{01 01 00} {07 14 00}\nHuh huh huh!{01 00 00 05 00} Am I good,\n{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{07 19 00}\"{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 02}{01 06 00} {01 07 00}{ff 00 00 00},\" right?{01 00 00 14 00}\n\n\n{07 0a 00}Cool! {01 00 00 05 00}From now on, I'm gonna\nsay \"{ff 00 00 02}{01 06 00} {01 07 00}{ff 00 00 00}\"\nwhen I swoop into a room!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "en": "{07 00 00}\"{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 02}{01 06 00} {01 07 00}{ff 00 00 00}\"!{01 00 00 0f 00}{01 01 00}\nHuh huh huh!{01 00 00 05 00} Did I sound\nlike a superhero?{02 01 00 0e 0f 10}\nTotally!\nKind of...\nScram, already!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "en": "{07 0a 00}Yesss! Sweet,{01 00 00 0a 00} {04 02 00}!{03 01 00 01}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "en": "{07 1b 00}Aw, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}.{01 01 00} {07 16 00}Don't you\nknow that a superhero also\nneeds a loyal sidekick?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Th{01 00 00 03 00}-that's so mean{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.\nSuperheroes have feelings,\ntoo! {01 01 00}{07 08 00}WAAAAAAA! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{03 03 00 01}",
   "et": ""
  }
 ]
